@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@
+/* Initialization of sw_64 specific backend library.
+   Copyright (C) 2002-2011 Red Hat, Inc.
+   This file is part of elfutils.
+   Written by Ulrich Drepper <drepper@redhat.com>, 2002.
